abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis of monthly streamflow and multi-constituent loads
  across agricultural watershed monitoring stations, including high-flow
  export enrichment, flow-load elasticity, temporal trends, export
  inequality, hydrological nonstationarity, and rolling-origin machine
  learning.

keywords:
  - agricultural watershed
  - contaminant export
  - hydrological nonstationarity
  - export inequality
  - machine learning
